{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Collapsing Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running out of room! In Space Smash, the playable area constantly shrinks. Collect blue energy orbs to gain more time and space \u2014 but avoid the red ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic arcade games, Space Smash is a fast-paced retro shmup focused on survival and high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1036490/extras/c63306957aebf4d4fdabc5adc4bb54bb.poster.avif?t=1776292746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1036490/extras/c63306957aebf4d4fdabc5adc4bb54bb.webm?t=1776292746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1036490/extras/c63306957aebf4d4fdabc5adc4bb54bb.mp4?t=1776292746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast Arcade Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, hard to master. Survive as long as possible and compete for the highest score on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts. One mistake and you'll be crushed by the space storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Unique Ships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins in the arena and unlock ships with different traits. Each one offers a new playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist Retro Arcade Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple graphics, retro sound effects, and pure gameplay inspired by 80s arcade classics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1036490/extras/58a1116106c506881e76349f12107ef6.poster.avif?t=1776292746\" width=1170 height=65